-- =====================================================================
-- Session 155 — Matt 20 extras-tier cross-references (single chapter)
-- =====================================================================
-- Adds Matt 20's extras-tier rows + threads to the cross-reference
-- corpus. Continues the S131 (Matt 1-2) -> S154 (Matt 17) extras-tier
-- coverage; Matt 20 lands as the laborers-in-the-vineyard parable +
-- third-passion-prediction + sons-of-Zavdai (Zebedee)-cup-and-baptism +
-- ransom-for-many + two-blind-men-at-Yericho (Jericho) chapter, paired
-- with Matt 19 per the rebuild-pairing-guide. Five framework-bearing
-- narrative movements anchor the chapter:
--
--   (a) the laborers-in-the-vineyard parable (vv.1-16) — Red Line #11
--       post-harvest-sifting / sovereign-grace-of-the-master /
--       kingdom-economy-not-natural-economy substance unpacking
--       Matt 19:30''s *first-shall-be-last-and-last-shall-be-first*
--       bridge-substance. The householder is the Father, the vineyard
--       is Yashar''el (Israel)''s covenant-body the prophets named
--       (Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 5:1-7, Yirmeyahu (Jeremiah) 12:10), the
--       same-penny-paid-to-each-at-sunset displays the kingdom-economy
--       distributed-by-the-householder''s-will; the first-hired''s
--       grumbling (Greek *egongyzon*) is the Tanakh-wilderness-substance
--       (Shemot (Exodus) 16:2, Bamidbar (Numbers) 14:27); the *friend*
--       (Greek *hetaire*) is the polite-address-of-correction the King
--       uses at Matt 22:12 and Matt 26:50; *is thine eye evil, because
--       I am good?* closes with the Hebrew good-eye / evil-eye idiom-
--       substance the King had named at Matt 6:22-23; the closing *many
--       be called, but few chosen* lands the parable at the cause-and-
--       effect-of-hearing the King has unfolded through every kingdom-
--       parable since Matt 13 — proclamation broadly because the sheep
--       are scattered, the *chosen* (Greek *eklektoi*) because the
--       names are written in the Book of Life from the foundation of
--       the world (Hitgalut (Revelation) 13:8, 17:8, John 10:26-27).
--       The substance carries the additional historic-redemptive
--       resonance — early-hired prefiguring Yahudah (Judah) the
--       southern-house-that-retained-the-tribal-identity, eleventh-
--       hour-laborers prefiguring the scattered-seed-of-Yashar''el
--       (Israel) now being-gathered-home through-the-King''s-
--       proclamation, the same-penny-of-inheritance ruling out
--       murmuring-against-the-late-coming-of-the-scattered-seed from
--       any quarter.
--   (b) the third passion-prediction (vv.17-19) — the most-specific
--       of the three predictions (Matt 16:21, 17:22-23, 20:17-19),
--       adding the chief-priests-and-scribes-condemnation + the
--       delivery-to-the-goyim (Gentiles) for the execution-substance +
--       the mock-scourge-crucify triple (Psalm 22:7-8 + Yeshayahu
--       (Isaiah) 50:6 + Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 53:5) + the third-day-
--       raising sealed at the close. The Wisdom of Solomon 2
--       prefiguring-passage the S154 thread *the-just-man-as-son-of-
--       yahuah-condemned-and-vindicated-in-wisdom-of-solomon-2*
--       carries forward the same substance from Matt 17:22-23; per the
--       Yoshi-S155 instruction, Matt 20:18-19 does call back to that
--       prefiguring-passage but the cleaner architectural-decision for
--       this migration is to build the S155 threads at the Matt-20-
--       distinctive substance and let the chapter-end card surfacing
--       the S154 thread''s prior-chapter material carry the Wisdom-of-
--       Solomon-2 anchor forward in-the-reader''s-reading-flow rather
--       than duplicate the verbal-anchor at fresh cross-reference rows.
--   (c) the mother-of-Zavdai (Zebedee)''s petition + the cup-and-
--       baptism substance + the ten-other-apostles'' indignation
--       (vv.20-24) — the petition for thrones-on-the-King''s-right-
--       and-left lands immediately after the third passion-prediction,
--       the juxtaposition itself naming the substance the disciples
--       still walk-in (the natural-kingdoms''-hierarchy-substance
--       still operating-beneath the kingdom-substance the King has
--       been laying-down); the King''s *ye know not what ye ask. Are
--       ye able to drink of the cup that I shall drink of?* invokes
--       the Tanakh-cup-of-wrath-substance the prophets have carried
--       (Psalm 75:8, Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 51:17, 21-22, Yirmeyahu
--       (Jeremiah) 25:15-16, Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) 23:32-34, Habakkuk
--       2:16); the *we are able* is confidence-without-comprehension;
--       the King confirms the sons will-drink-the-cup at the
--       apostolic-mission-cost-level (Ya''aqov (James) at Acts 12:2,
--       Yochanan (John) at Hitgalut (Revelation) 1:9) — NOT at the
--       substitutionary-substance-level (that substance is the King''s-
--       only-to-drink); *not mine to give, but it shall be given to
--       them for whom it is prepared of my Father* preserves the
--       Father''s-prerogative per the Father-Son-architecture (John
--       5:19-20, 6:38, 14:10).
--   (d) the servant-of-all teaching + the *ransom-for-many* framework-
--       major moment (vv.25-28) — *Ye know that the princes of the
--       goyim (Gentiles) exercise dominion (Greek katakyrieuousin)
--       over them, and they that are great exercise authority
--       (katexousiazousin) upon them. But it shall not be so among
--       you: but whosoever will be great among you, let him be your
--       minister (diakonos — table-server); And whosoever will be
--       chief among you, let him be your servant (doulos — bond-
--       servant): even as the Son of Adam came not to be ministered
--       unto, but to minister, and to give his life a ransom for
--       many.* The King names himself explicitly as the Tanakh-
--       Suffering-Servant of Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 53 and the *kofer*-
--       ransom-substance of the Torah (Shemot (Exodus) 21:30, 30:12-
--       13, 16; Bamidbar (Numbers) 35:31-33; Psalm 49:6-9; Yeshayahu
--       (Isaiah) 53:10-12; Daniel 9:24-27). The *many* (Greek
--       *pollōn*) reads as the *rabbim* of the Servant-passage — the
--       substantial-multitude the Father''s-Book-of-Life from-the-
--       foundation-of-the-world has named — neither the universalist-
--       collapse nor the limited-atonement-restrictivism but the
--       Three-Categories-architecture the framework reads across the
--       gathering-arc. Framework-major. The post-harvest sifting +
--       grace-as-door-home substance (Red Line #11 + the *Grace, the
--       Way, the New Heart, and the Mercy of Depart* section of
--       framework-deep.md) is the architecture the cross-substance
--       opens-onto without cancelling-the-curse-system; the cup-the-
--       King-drinks opens-the-door-to-the-new-heart-substance the
--       Spirit causes-the-disciple-to-walk-in.
--   (e) the two-blind-men at Yericho (Jericho) + the *Son of David*
--       Messianic-confession (vv.29-34) — the chapter closes at
--       Yericho (Jericho), the city of the original-entry-into-the-
--       Land under Yahoshua (Joshua) son of Nun (Joshua 6:20); the
--       blind-men''s cry *thou Son of David, have mercy on us* invokes
--       the Tanakh-Davidic-Messianic substance the prophets carried
--       (2 Samuel 7:12-16; Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 11:1-2, 10; Yirmeyahu
--       (Jeremiah) 23:5-6; Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) 34:23-24, 37:24-25);
--       the marginalized-substance recognizes the Davidic-Messianic-
--       substance the surrounding-multitude cannot see (the seed-war-
--       hearing-pattern of John 10:26-27 operating at the
--       marginalized-level); the multitude-rebuke is met by the
--       greater-cry, and the King''s-stopping-and-calling-and-asking-
--       and-touching fulfils the Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 35:5 Messianic-
--       credential the gospel has been carrying since Matt 11:4-5; the
--       closing *they followed him* is the discipleship-substance the
--       substantial-hearing-and-seeing produces — the cause-and-
--       effect-of-hearing the parable-substance at the chapter-
--       opening laid-down, now substantiated at the chapter-closing.
--
-- The extras-library adds five framework-bearing thread-clusters:
--   Thread 1: Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 24 + Sirach 33 + 2 Esdras (4
--     Ezra) 5 + 2 Esdras 9 on the vineyard-of-Yashar''el (Israel) +
--     sovereign-grace-of-the-master-distributing-the-same-penny
--     substance — the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the
--     architecture the laborers-in-the-vineyard parable rests upon.
--   Thread 2: 1 Enoch 39 + 1 Enoch 48 + 2 Esdras 8 on the cause-and-
--     effect-of-hearing — many-called-but-few-chosen substance — the
--     wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the names-written-in-
--     the-Book-of-Life-from-the-foundation-of-the-world architecture
--     the parable closes on at Matt 20:16 and the framework reads per
--     Red Line #11.
--   Thread 3: Wisdom of Solomon 3 + Wisdom of Solomon 5 + 2 Maccabees
--     7 on the cup-of-suffering and the vindication-of-the-righteous
--     substance — the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the
--     Tanakh-cup-of-wrath the prophets carried and the substantial-
--     martyrdom-substance the disciples will-drink at the apostolic-
--     mission-cost-level the King''s-answer at v.23 confirms.
--   Thread 4 (FRAMEWORK-MAJOR): 1 Enoch''s Son-of-Adam Parables (ch
--     46, 48, 62) + Testaments of the Twelve Patriarchs 94 + Sirach
--     (Ecclesiasticus) 3 on the Son-of-Adam-came-not-to-be-ministered-
--     unto-but-to-minister-and-give-his-life-a-ransom-for-many
--     substance — the wisdom-stream and pseudepigraphal-stream
--     articulation of the lowly-on-earth-and-glorious-in-heaven +
--     greatness-through-humility architecture the King names at the
--     chapter-pivot at v.28. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR for the Son-of-Adam-and-
--     ransom-substance per Red Line #12 and the *Grace, the Way, the
--     New Heart, and the Mercy of Depart* section of framework-deep.md.
--   Thread 5: Testaments of the Twelve Patriarchs 37-38 on the star-
--     from-Ya''aqov (Jacob) + Branch-of-Elohim + sceptre-of-the-
--     kingdom Davidic-Messianic substance — the wisdom-stream''s
--     direct articulation of the Davidic-Messianic credential the
--     marginalized two-blind-men at Yericho (Jericho) recognize at
--     vv.29-34.
--
-- Notes on prior-session collisions per the Yoshi-S155 instruction:
--   * S154 threads at sort 307-311 are protected; this migration uses
--     fresh thread-slugs at sort 322-326.
--   * S146''s `reward-according-to-works-post-harvest-sifting` thread
--     at sort 306 is the most-likely Red Line #11 reward-by-works
--     callback for the laborers-in-the-vineyard substance — but the
--     Matt 20 parable''s distinctive architecture is the same-penny-
--     to-each / sovereign-grace-of-the-master / NOT-reward-by-works
--     architecture, which is the inverse-substance of the S146 thread.
--     Thread 1 below builds the Matt-20-anchored substance fresh; no
--     new members are added to the S146 thread (the laborers-parable
--     substance is the categorical-inversion of works-rewarded, not a
--     continuation-of-it).
--   * The Wisdom of Solomon 2 prefiguring-passage S154 thread carries
--     forward to Matt 20:18-19 substance per the standing third-
--     passion-prediction continuity-line, but the cleaner architectural-
--     decision for this single-chapter migration is to build the
--     S155 threads at the Matt-20-distinctive substance and let the
--     chapter-end card''s prior-chapter-thread surfacing carry the
--     Wisdom-of-Solomon-2 anchor forward in-the-reader''s-reading-
--     flow rather than duplicate the verbal-anchor at fresh cross-
--     reference rows.
--
-- Historical-witness editions (Josephus, M.R. James''s apocryphal NT,
-- Lightfoot''s Apostolic Fathers) remain deferred from V1 cross-refs
-- per the historical-witness one-way rule. Jubilees, Jasher, Adam-Eve
-- Conflict, Apocalypse of Abraham, and Sonnini''s Acts of Paul do not
-- surface framework-bearing Matt 20 connections at S155 (the
-- vineyard-of-Yashar''el-and-grape-of-the-cluster substance lands
-- strongest at 2 Esdras 5 and 9; the cup-of-suffering substance lands
-- at Wisdom of Solomon and 2 Maccabees 7; the Son-of-Adam-Parables
-- substance lands at 1 Enoch; the Davidic-Messianic-star-and-branch
-- substance lands at Testaments of the Twelve). The lookup view
-- retains the S146-S154 edition set for forward compatibility.
--
-- Five PROPOSED threads at extras-tier:
--   1. `the-vineyard-of-yashar-el-and-the-sovereign-grace-of-the-master-in-sirach-and-2-esdras`    (sort 322)
--   2. `many-be-called-but-few-chosen-in-1-enoch-and-2-esdras`                                     (sort 323)
--   3. `the-cup-of-suffering-and-the-vindication-of-the-righteous-in-wisdom-of-solomon-and-2-maccabees`  (sort 324)
--   4. `the-son-of-adam-came-to-give-his-life-a-ransom-for-many-in-1-enoch-testaments-and-sirach`  (sort 325)
--   5. `the-davidic-messianic-son-recognized-by-the-marginalized-in-testaments-of-the-twelve`      (sort 326)
--
-- 21 new cross_references rows at tier_required=''extras'' (Library
-- tier, $4.99) + 5 new cross_reference_threads at tier_required=
-- ''complete_study'' (Companion tier, $9.99). The tier split honors
-- the chapter-end-card architecture established at S146-S154: Layer 1
-- (per-verse cross-refs) visible to Library readers; Layer 2 (thread
-- callouts with summary_md + member_notes) gated at Companion. Every
-- member-note passes the 12 Red Lines and the 12-point editorial
-- checklist. The seed-mechanism per framework-deep''s *Paternal Seed
-- and the Marriage-Covenant Absorption* section + Red Line #7
-- augmentation does not surface in Matt 20 (no foreign-origin
-- individuals or seed-distinction substance in the chapter — all
-- twelve-tribe-substance is internal to the covenant-body, and the
-- two-blind-men-at-Yericho (Jericho) are within-the-covenant-people
-- whose Davidic-Messianic-recognition is the cause-and-effect-of-
-- hearing the marginalized-substance walks-in).
-- Hebrew names with internal apostrophes (Yashar''el, Ya''aqov,
-- Yechezk''el, Yo''el, Sha''ul, Yo''asher, Mikha''el, Mosheh''s,
-- King''s, Father''s, Yahuah''s, Yochanan''s, Kefa''s, etc.) and
-- English possessives (wisdom-stream''s, master''s, Father''s,
-- King''s, system''s, etc.) are escaped per SQL single-quoted-string-
-- literal convention (every internal ' doubled to '').
--
-- Idempotent: ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING on every INSERT.
-- =====================================================================

\echo 'Session 155 — Matt 20 extras-tier cross-references migration starting...'
BEGIN;

-- Verse-lookup temp view. Mirrors the S154 view; retained for forward
-- compatibility even though Matt 20 surfaces only canon + enoch +
-- apocrypha + pseudepigrapha at S155.
CREATE TEMP VIEW _s155_xref_lookup AS
SELECT
    e.slug AS edition_slug,
    b.slug AS book_slug,
    c.chapter_number,
    v.verse_number,
    v.id AS verse_id
  FROM verses v
  JOIN chapters c ON v.chapter_id = c.id
  JOIN books    b ON c.book_id    = b.id
  JOIN editions e ON b.edition_id = e.id
 WHERE e.slug IN (
       'canon',
       'enoch',
       'jubilees',
       'jasher',
       'apocrypha',
       'apocrypha-charles-vol1',
       'pseudepigrapha',
       'adam-eve-conflict',
       'apocalypse-of-abraham',
       'ascension-isaiah',
       'sonnini-acts-29'
   );

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Insert 21 extras-tier cross_references rows.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
WITH input(src_edition, src_slug, src_ch, src_v,
           tgt_edition, tgt_slug, tgt_ch, tgt_v, note) AS (VALUES

  -- Thread 1: the-vineyard-of-yashar-el-and-the-sovereign-grace-of-the-master-in-sirach-and-2-esdras
  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 1, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 24, 8,
   '*So the Creator of all things gave me a commandment, and he that made me caused my tabernacle to rest, and said, Let your dwelling be in Jacob, and your inheritance in Yashar''el (Israel).* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 24:8 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the wisdom-of-Yahuah''s-being-planted-in-Yashar''el (Israel) substance — the same vineyard-of-Yashar''el (Israel) architecture the prophet Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 5:1-7 names (*the vineyard of Yahuah Tseva''ot (LORD of hosts) is the house of Yashar''el (Israel)*) and the prophet Yirmeyahu (Jeremiah) 12:10 names (*many pastors have destroyed my vineyard*). The framework reads the verse against Matt 20:1''s *the kingdom of heaven is like unto a man that is an householder, which went out early in the morning to hire labourers into his vineyard.* The vineyard the King names is the same vineyard-of-Yashar''el (Israel) the prophets and the wisdom-stream had named — the covenant-body the Father planted-and-fenced-and-tended-for-fruit. The householder is the Father; the laborers are those-the-Father-calls into the vineyard''s-substance across the day''s hours; the substance the King opens-the-parable with is the substance the wisdom-stream and the prophetic-corpus together had named centuries before.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 1, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 24, 12,
   '*And I took root in an honourable people, even in the portion of the inheritance of Yahuah (God).* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 24:12 names the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the wisdom-rooted-in-the-honourable-people substance — the covenant-people the Father has-elected-as-the-portion-of-his-inheritance. The framework reads the verse against Matt 20:1''s vineyard-as-the-covenant-body-of-Yashar''el (Israel). The wisdom-stream had named the substance of the rooted-in-Yashar''el (Israel)-as-Yahuah''s-inheritance architecture the laborers-in-the-vineyard parable rests upon. The framework reads this in continuity with Red Line #11''s natural-branches-and-wild-olive-branches architecture — both branches of the olive tree are Yashar''el (Israel), the natural branches the covenant-lineage from Avraham (Abraham) / Yitschaq (Isaac) / Ya''aqov (Jacob) through-the-twelve-tribes, the wild olive branches the descendants-of-those-covenant-lines-who-grew-up-among-the-nations-in-scattering; the vineyard the parable names is the same covenant-body the wisdom-stream and the prophets named.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 15, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 33, 13,
   '*As the clay is in the potter''s hand, to fashion it at his pleasure: so man is in the hand of him that made him, to render to them as liketh him best.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 33:13 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the sovereign-distribution-by-the-master''s-will substance the householder''s closing-question at Matt 20:15 articulates — *is it not lawful for me to do what I will with mine own? Is thine eye evil, because I am good?* The wisdom-stream and the Tanakh-substance (Job 41:11''s *whatsoever is under the whole heaven is mine*; Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 64:8''s *we are the clay, and thou our potter*; Yirmeyahu (Jeremiah) 18:6''s *as the clay is in the potter''s hand, so are ye in mine hand*) had named the architecture of the Father''s-prerogative-over-the-Father''s-own-substance the parable rests upon. The framework reads this carefully — the sovereign-distribution is NOT the Reformed-monergistic-determinism-without-the-substance-of-disposition-walked, NOR the Arminian-libertarian-self-determinative-freedom-without-the-Father''s-foreknowledge; the BOTH-AND-not-EITHER-OR architecture per Red Line #11''s cause-and-effect-of-hearing the framework reads across the canon. The Father distributes-the-substance the Father wills, and the substance-the-citizen-walks reveals-the-substance-the-Father-has-known from-before-the-foundation.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 1, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 5, 23,
   '*O Yahuah (God) that bearest rule, of every wood of the earth, and of all the trees thereof, you have chosen you one only vine.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 5:23 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the one-only-vine-the-Father-has-chosen substance — the Father''s-election of the vineyard-of-Yashar''el (Israel) out-of-all-the-trees-of-the-earth the prophet Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 5:7 also names. The framework reads the verse against Matt 20:1''s vineyard-as-the-covenant-body. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture of the Father''s-singular-election-of-the-vineyard centuries before the King articulates the substance at the gospel-pivot. The substance rules-out the Christian-replacement-theology that would graft-the-nations-into-the-vineyard-as-a-new-branch by faith-confession, AND rules-out the Hebrew-Roots-false-inclusion-gospel that would make-anyone-who-Torah-keeps-into-Yashar''el (Israel) regardless-of-paternal-lineage. The one-only-vine the Father has chosen IS Yashar''el (Israel) the paternal-blood-remnant the prophets named.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 16, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 9, 22,
   '*Let the multitude perish then, which was born in vain; and let my grape be kept, and my plant; for with great labour have I made it perfect.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 9:22 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the many-perish-but-the-grape-and-the-plant-are-kept substance — the same substance the King''s closing *many be called, but few chosen* at Matt 20:16 names. The framework reads the verse against the cause-and-effect-of-hearing the parable closes on. The wisdom-stream and the gospel cohere at the architecture: the broad-proclamation goes-out because the citizens-of-the-kingdom are scattered-among-the-nations, the *grape* and *plant* the Father has-kept-with-great-labour are the substantial-multitude the Father''s-Book-of-Life from-the-foundation-of-the-world has named (Hitgalut (Revelation) 13:8, 17:8). The substance is NOT the Reformed-monergistic-determinism (which would collapse the substance into Father-unilaterally-chooses-without-disposition-walked), NOR the Arminian-libertarian-freedom (which would collapse the substance into citizen-chooses-without-the-Father''s-foreknowledge) — the substance is BOTH-AND, per Red Line #11''s cause-and-effect-of-hearing architecture; the *great labour* the Father has-walked through-the-Father''s-preservation-of-the-paternal-blood-remnant across-the-long-arc-of-the-gathering.'),

  -- Thread 2: many-be-called-but-few-chosen-in-1-enoch-and-2-esdras
  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 16, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 39, 1,
   '*And it shall come to pass in those days that the elect and holy children of the earth will behold the secrets of the heaven, and the kingdom of the Elect One shall be revealed to them, and they shall rejoice and be glad.* 1 Enoch 39:1 names the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the elect-and-holy-children substance — the same *eklektoi* (Greek *chosen*) the King names at Matt 20:16''s *many be called, but few chosen.* The framework reads the verse against the cause-and-effect-of-hearing the parable closes on. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture of the elect-and-holy-children-of-the-earth-who-behold-the-secrets-of-the-heaven centuries before; the kingdom-of-the-Elect-One the parable-of-the-laborers-in-the-vineyard articulates the citizens-of is the same kingdom-of-the-Elect-One the wisdom-stream names. Per Red Line #11''s cause-and-effect-of-hearing — the elect hear because they ARE elect; the hearing reveals what was already true from the foundation of the world.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 16, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 48, 1,
   '*And in that place I saw the fountain of righteousness which was inexhaustible: and around it were many fountains of wisdom: and all the thirsty drank of them, and were filled with wisdom, and their dwellings were with the righteous and holy and elect.* 1 Enoch 48:1 names the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the all-the-thirsty-drank-and-were-filled substance — the broad-proclamation-substance that reaches-the-many. The framework reads the verse against Matt 20:16''s *many be called.* The wisdom-stream had named the architecture of the broad-fountain-the-thirsty-drink-from at the prefiguring-register; the gospel-proclamation goes-out broadly because the citizens-of-the-kingdom are scattered-among-the-nations and the proclaimers do-not-know-the-citizens-by-sight. The substance is the broad-substance through-which the citizens-the-Father-has-known emerge — the *thirsty* are the ones whose names-are-written-in-the-Book-of-Life-from-the-foundation-of-the-world and who-hear-the-Shepherd-when-the-Shepherd-calls (John 10:27).'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 16, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 8, 1,
   '*And he answered me, saying, The most High has made this world for many, but the world to come for few.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 8:1 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the many-but-few substance the King''s closing *many be called, but few chosen* at Matt 20:16 lands. The framework reads the verse against the cause-and-effect-of-hearing the parable closes on. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture of the world-made-for-many but the world-to-come-for-few at the prefiguring-register centuries before the gospel-pivot. The framework reads this in continuity with Red Line #11''s post-harvest-sifting architecture — the harvest separates wheat from tares (Matt 13:30); the gathered-wheat then passes through a post-harvest-sifting (Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) 20:37-38; Matt 25:32; Luke 3:17); the substantial-multitude of the *many* are called-broadly because the sheep are scattered, and the *few* are the ones who hear-because-they-are-sheep and walk-the-substance-of-the-fruit-bearing the post-harvest-sifting tests-for.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 16, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 8, 3,
   '*There be many created, but few shall be saved.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 8:3 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the *many-but-few* substance — even more pointed than 8:1 at the saved-substance-itself. The framework reads the verse against Matt 20:16''s *many be called, but few chosen.* The substance the wisdom-stream names is NOT the Reformed-eternal-security-without-the-walking, which would collapse the substance into the Father-unilaterally-saves-from-the-foundation-without-the-disposition-walked; NOR is it the Arminian-perfectability-by-effort, which would collapse the substance into the citizen-saves-himself-by-walking. The substance is the cause-and-effect-of-hearing per Red Line #11 — the *few* are the ones whose names-were-written-in-the-Book-of-Life-from-the-foundation-of-the-world AND who hear-because-they-are-sheep AND who walk-the-substance-of-the-fruit-bearing the post-harvest-sifting tests-for. Names get blotted-out at the post-harvest-sifting for lawlessness; the warning is to wheat, not to tares. The *few-saved* is the substance of the wheat-that-bears-fruit-and-is-not-blotted-out, not the tares-that-were-never-written.'),

  -- Thread 3: the-cup-of-suffering-and-the-vindication-of-the-righteous-in-wisdom-of-solomon-and-2-maccabees
  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 22, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 3, 1,
   '*But the souls of the righteous are in the hand of Yahuah (God), and there shall no torment touch them.* Wisdom of Solomon 3:1 names the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the righteous-in-the-hand-of-Yahuah substance — the substantial-preservation through-the-cup-of-suffering. The framework reads the verse against Matt 20:22''s *are ye able to drink of the cup that I shall drink of, and to be baptized with the baptism that I am baptized with?* The cup the King is about-to-drink is the Tanakh-cup-of-wrath the prophets carried (Psalm 75:8, Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 51:17, 21-22, Yirmeyahu (Jeremiah) 25:15-16) — substantially-poured-on-the-Son-of-Adam-on-the-cross at the substitutionary-substance-level. The cup the sons of Zavdai (Zebedee) will-drink is the apostolic-mission-cost cup — Ya''aqov (James) killed-with-the-sword by Herodes-Agrippa-I at Acts 12:2, Yochanan (John) walking-the-substance-of-tribulation across the long-apostolic-mission to Patmos (Hitgalut (Revelation) 1:9). Wisdom of Solomon 3:1 names the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the substantial-preservation through the apostolic-mission-cost cup — the souls-of-the-righteous in-the-hand-of-Yahuah, no-torment-touching-them at the eternal-substance-level even-while the substantial-suffering passes-through the temporal-substance.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 23, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 5, 1,
   '*Then shall the righteous man stand in great boldness before the face of such as have afflicted him, and made no account of his labours.* Wisdom of Solomon 5:1 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the righteous-man-standing-in-vindication-before-the-afflicting-system substance — the post-suffering vindication-of-the-righteous the day-of-Yahuah will reveal. The framework reads the verse against Matt 20:23''s King''s-answer *ye shall drink indeed of my cup, and be baptized with the baptism that I am baptized with* — the sons will-drink-the-cup at the apostolic-mission-cost-level. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture of the post-suffering vindication of the righteous at the prefiguring-register; the sons will-walk into the apostolic-mission-cost and then-into-the-vindication-substance the wisdom-stream names. The framework reads this in continuity with the kingdom-citizens''-substance the King is about-to-articulate at vv.25-28 — greatness-as-service in the temporal-substance, vindication-and-rest at the eternal-substance.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 23, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 5, 15,
   '*But the righteous live for evermore; their reward also is with Yahuah (God), and the care of them is with the Most High.* Wisdom of Solomon 5:15 names the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the righteous-live-for-evermore + reward-with-Yahuah substance — the eschatological-vindication that closes the cup-of-suffering substance. The framework reads the verse against Matt 20:23''s preserved-Father''s-prerogative at the assignment-of-the-thrones substance — *not mine to give, but it shall be given to them for whom it is prepared of my Father.* The Father''s-prerogative the King''s-statement preserves is the same Father''s-prerogative the wisdom-stream names at Wisdom of Solomon 5:15''s *reward also is with Yahuah (God).* The framework reads this carefully — the reward is NOT the Pharisaic-flesh-merit-earned-by-Torah-performance (which collapses into the works-of-the-law erga-nomou the Galatian agitators preached), NOR the Reformed-no-condition-on-the-believer (which collapses into the cancellation-of-the-curse-system the framework rules-out per the *Grace, the Way, the New Heart, and the Mercy of Depart* section of framework-deep.md); the reward is the Father''s-distribution-by-the-Father''s-will at the substance the substantial-walking-in-the-Way reveals.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 22, 'apocrypha', '2-maccabees', 7, 37,
   '*But I, as my brothers, offer up my body and life for the laws of our fathers, beseeching Yahuah (God) that he would speedily be merciful to our nation.* 2 Maccabees 7:37 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the substantial-martyrdom-substance — the youngest brother offers-up-body-and-life-for-the-laws-of-the-fathers-and-the-mercy-of-the-nation, the most-direct extras-stream prefiguring of the substitutionary-death-for-others architecture. The framework reads the verse against Matt 20:22''s *are ye able to drink of the cup that I shall drink of?* The seven-Maccabean-brothers walked-the-substance-of-substantial-martyrdom under-the-tyrant-Antiochus at the apostolic-mission-cost level (not at the substitutionary-substance level — that substance is the King''s-only-to-drink); the wisdom-stream had named the architecture of the body-and-life-offered-up-for-the-laws-of-the-fathers-and-the-mercy-of-the-nation at the prefiguring-register; the sons of Zavdai (Zebedee) will-walk the same apostolic-mission-cost substance in their own apostolic-life. The framework reads this in continuity with 2 Maccabees 7''s broader-substance of the resurrection-confession the seven-brothers walk-in (vv.9, 14, 23, 29) — the substance the King''s third-day-raising at v.19 vindicates-and-completes.'),

  -- Thread 4: the-son-of-adam-came-to-give-his-life-a-ransom-for-many-in-1-enoch-testaments-and-sirach
  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 28, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 46, 3,
   '*This is the Son of Adam who hath righteousness, with whom dwelleth righteousness, and who revealeth all the treasures of that which is hidden, because Yahuah (God) of Spirits hath chosen him.* 1 Enoch 46:3 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the named-Son-of-Adam-who-hath-righteousness substance — the Parables-of-Enoch (chs 37-71) had carried the Son-of-Adam architecture centuries before the gospels articulated it at the gospel-pivot. The framework reads the verse against Matt 20:28''s framework-major *even as the Son of Adam came not to be ministered unto, but to minister, and to give his life a ransom for many.* The King names himself explicitly as the Son-of-Adam the wisdom-stream had named — the One whom-Yahuah-of-Spirits-hath-chosen, with whom-dwelleth-righteousness. The framework reads this as FRAMEWORK-MAJOR per Red Line #12''s Son-of-Adam-restoration — the title-substance carries the Adamic-seed-of-promise the canon names through every Son-of-Adam title-position; the *son of Adam* restoration of the inherited-translation''s *son of man* preserves the lineage-weight the title carries. The substance the King is about-to-give is the substance-of-the-Adamic-line-of-promise the Father has-carried through-the-prophets to-the-substance-of-the-substantial-ransom-paid-by-the-Son-of-Adam himself.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 28, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 48, 2,
   '*And at that hour that Son of Adam was named in the presence of Yahuah (God) of Spirits, and his name before the Head of Days.* 1 Enoch 48:2 names the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the Son-of-Adam-named-before-the-foundation substance — *yea, before the sun and the signs were created, before the stars of the heaven were made, his name was named before Yahuah (God) of Spirits* (48:3). The framework reads the verse against Matt 20:28''s *the Son of Adam came not to be ministered unto, but to minister, and to give his life a ransom for many.* The Son-of-Adam-who-came is the same Son-of-Adam-named-before-the-foundation; the substance-of-the-coming was determined by-the-Father from-before-the-foundation-of-the-world; the substantial-ransom is NOT a defeat-imposed-by-circumstances but the substance the Son-walked-into-knowingly under-the-Father''s-determination from-before-the-foundation (per the *must* / *dei* of divine-necessity at Matt 16:21''s first passion-prediction). The framework reads this in continuity with Hitgalut (Revelation) 13:8''s *the Lamb slain from the foundation of the world.*'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 28, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 62, 9,
   '*And this Son of Adam whom thou hast seen shall raise up the kings and the mighty from their seats, and the strong from their thrones, and shall loosen the reins of the strong, and break the teeth of the sinners.* 1 Enoch 62:9 names the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the eschatological-judgment-and-vindication substance of the Son-of-Adam — the same Son-of-Adam-on-the-throne-of-his-glory the Parables-of-Enoch name as the eschatological-judge. The framework reads the verse against Matt 20:28''s substance-of-the-coming-not-to-be-ministered-unto-but-to-minister-and-to-give-his-life-a-ransom-for-many. The kingdom-citizens''-substance the King-walks (greatness-as-service) is the inverse-substance of the natural-kingdoms''-administration (greatness-as-domination under-the-watcher-rebellion-administration per Daniel 10:13, 20; Ephesians 6:12); the substantial-judgment the Son-of-Adam will-walk at the eschatological-vindication-day (1 Enoch 62:9) is the inverse-substance of the substantial-ransom the Son-of-Adam walks-in-the-flesh-at-the-cross (Matt 20:28). Same Son-of-Adam; substantially-yielded-at-the-first-coming, substantially-vindicating-at-the-second-coming; the wisdom-stream and the gospel cohere at the architecture per Red Line #12.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 28, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 94, 5,
   '*And I know how lowly He shall be upon earth, and how glorious in heaven.* Testaments of the Twelve Patriarchs 94:5 (Testament of Benjamin 9) names THE direct extras-stream verbal-anchor for the lowly-on-earth-and-glorious-in-heaven substance — the precise architecture the King names at Matt 20:28''s *the Son of Adam came not to be ministered unto, but to minister, and to give his life a ransom for many.* The framework reads the verse as the most-direct pseudepigraphal-anchor for the kenotic-incarnational architecture the King articulates at the chapter-pivot. The Tanakh-Suffering-Servant-substance the King draws-from at v.28 (Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 53:3''s *despised and rejected of men; a man of sorrows*; 53:5-6''s *wounded for our transgressions ... Yahuah (the LORD) hath laid on him the iniquity of us all*; 53:10-12''s *make his soul an offering for sin ... bare the sin of many*) is the same lowly-on-earth substance Testaments 94:5 names; the eschatological-glorious-in-heaven substance the wisdom-stream points-forward-to is the same substance 1 Enoch 62''s Son-of-Adam-on-the-throne-of-his-glory names. The framework reads this in continuity with Philippians 2:6-11''s *made himself of no reputation, and took upon him the form of a servant ... wherefore Elohim (God) also hath highly exalted him* — the apostolic-witness restates the substance the King''s-own-mouth named at the gospel-pivot and the wisdom-and-pseudepigraphal-stream named at the prefiguring-register.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 26, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 3, 18,
   '*The greater you are, the more humble thyself, and you shall find favour before Yahuah (God).* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 3:18 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the greater-the-more-humble substance — the precise inverse-architecture the King names at Matt 20:26-27''s *whosoever will be great among you, let him be your minister (diakonos — table-server); and whosoever will be chief among you, let him be your servant (doulos — bond-servant).* The framework reads the verse against the categorical-inversion the King lays *against* the natural-kingdoms''-domination substance. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture of the greater-the-more-humble at the wisdom-instruction-register; the King names the operative-form at the kingdom-citizens''-substance-level — the substance kingdom-greatness-flows-up-as-service operates as the categorical-inverse of the natural-kingdoms''-greatness-flowing-down-as-domination under-the-watcher-rebellion-administration (Daniel 10:13, 20; Ephesians 6:12; 1 John 5:19). The framework reads this in continuity with the *blessed-are-the-poor-in-spirit* of Matt 5:3, the *whosoever-shall-humble-himself-as-this-little-child* of Matt 18:4, the foot-washing-substance the King models at John 13:15-17, and the apostle Kefa (Peter)''s exhortation to the elders at 1 Peter 5:1-3''s *neither as being lords over Elohim (God)''s heritage, but being ensamples to the flock.* The substance is the same-substance through-the-wisdom-stream and-through-the-King and-through-the-apostles.'),

  -- Thread 5: the-davidic-messianic-son-recognized-by-the-marginalized-in-testaments-of-the-twelve
  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 30, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 37, 5,
   '*And after these things shall a star arise to you from Jacob in peace.* Testaments of the Twelve Patriarchs 37:5 (Testament of Levi 18 / Testament of Yahudah (Judah) 24 cluster, depending on the recension-positioning the parsed-text preserves) names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the star-from-Ya''aqov (Jacob) substance — the Davidic-Messianic credential the marginalized two-blind-men at Yericho (Jericho) recognize at Matt 20:30''s *thou Son of David, have mercy on us.* The framework reads the verse in continuity with Bamidbar (Numbers) 24:17''s *there shall come a Star out of Ya''aqov (Jacob), and a Sceptre shall rise out of Yashar''el (Israel)* the prophet Bila''am (Balaam) had carried at the pre-entry-to-the-Land vision. The wisdom-stream and the Tanakh-prophetic-witness cohere — the star-from-Ya''aqov (Jacob) substance is the same Davidic-Messianic credential the marginalized-substance walks-into-recognizing at the gospel-pivot.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 30, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 38, 4,
   '*This Branch of Elohim (God) Most High, and this Fountain giving life unto all.* Testaments of the Twelve Patriarchs 38:4 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the Branch-of-Elohim-Most-High substance — the same righteous-Branch the prophet Yirmeyahu (Jeremiah) 23:5-6 names (*I will raise unto David a righteous Branch ... this is his name whereby he shall be called, Yahuah Tsidkenu (THE LORD OUR RIGHTEOUSNESS)*) and the prophet Zekharyah (Zechariah) 6:12 names (*behold the man whose name is The BRANCH*). The framework reads the verse against Matt 20:30''s *thou Son of David, have mercy on us.* The Branch the wisdom-stream names is the same Son-of-David the marginalized two-blind-men recognize. The framework reads this in continuity with Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 11:1''s *there shall come forth a rod out of the stem of Yishai (Jesse), and a Branch shall grow out of his roots* and Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) 34:23-24''s *I will set up one shepherd over them, and he shall feed them, even my servant David.* The substance is the same-substance through-the-wisdom-stream and-through-the-prophets.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 20, 31, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 38, 5,
   '*Then shall the sceptre of my kingdom shine forth; and from your root shall arise a stem.* Testaments of the Twelve Patriarchs 38:5 names the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the sceptre-of-the-kingdom-shining-forth + root-with-stem-arising substance — the Davidic-Messianic credential extended through the wisdom-stream''s prefiguring at the same register as Bamidbar (Numbers) 24:17''s star-and-sceptre prophecy. The framework reads the verse against Matt 20:31''s persistence-substance — *but they cried the more, saying, Have mercy on us, O Lord, thou Son of David.* The marginalized-substance recognizes-the-sceptre-of-the-kingdom-shining-forth-through-the-King even when-the-surrounding-multitude rebukes-them; the seed-war-hearing-pattern operates at the marginalized-level (John 10:26-27''s *my sheep hear my voice*); the wisdom-stream had named the Davidic-Messianic credential at the prefiguring-register; the marginalized recognize-the-substance the surrounding-system cannot-see. The framework reads this in continuity with the Matt 9:27-31 Galilean-two-blind-men, the Matt 15:22 Canaanite-woman, anticipating the Matt 21:9 triumphal-entry *Hoshanna (Hosanna) to the Son of David* substance.')

)
INSERT INTO cross_references (source_verse_id, target_verse_id, source, note, tier_required)
SELECT sv.verse_id, tv.verse_id, 'manual', i.note, 'extras'::content_tier
  FROM input i
  JOIN _s155_xref_lookup sv ON sv.edition_slug   = i.src_edition
                           AND sv.book_slug      = i.src_slug
                           AND sv.chapter_number = i.src_ch
                           AND sv.verse_number   = i.src_v
  JOIN _s155_xref_lookup tv ON tv.edition_slug   = i.tgt_edition
                           AND tv.book_slug      = i.tgt_slug
                           AND tv.chapter_number = i.tgt_ch
                           AND tv.verse_number   = i.tgt_v
 WHERE sv.verse_id <> tv.verse_id
ON CONFLICT (source_verse_id, target_verse_id, source) DO NOTHING;

